OL,3,GNEWSAFinding Iris Murdoch artwork in
OL,4,Aattic 'a thrill'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMiles Leeson has been studying Dame
OL,7,FIris Murdoch - one of Britain's
OL,8,Fbest-loved authors - for more than a
OL,9,Fdecade.
OL,11,FSo when he got a call last year
OL,12,Falerting him to the possible discovery
OL,13,Fof new work by the writer, he did not
OL,14,Fget his hopes up straight away.
OL,16,FBut, climbing into a dusty Oxford
OL,17,Fattic, he was gobsmacked to find a
OL,18,Ftreasure trove of art created by the
OL,19,FBooker Prize-winning novelist.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
